  "info": {
    "title": "Keel PLM options and variants API",
    "description": "Option families and values, option rules, named variants and their release, option usage conditions on BOM lines, and the structure resolved for one variant. A product you may not read answers 404, like one that does not exist. Documented in docs/adr/0039-configuration-and-variants.md.",
